# Kav Landseeker: "When this creature enters, create a Lander token. At the beginning of the end step on your next turn,
# sacrifice that token." (CR 603.7). Each Lander waits for the end step of the first turn of Bot1's that begins after the
# ability resolved:
# - Turn 1 (Bot1's own): Lander A. Turn 1's own end step and Bot2's turn 2 pass it by; it goes at turn 3's end step.
# - Turn 4 (Bot2's), Ephemerate blinks Kav: Lander B, made on an opponent's turn, goes at the end step of Bot1's turn 5.
# - Turn 5's upkeep, Ephemerate rebounds: Lander C, made on Bot1's own turn 5, waits for turn 7's end step, not turn 5's.

